@VyaaparNexus.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5117
@apiKey = vyaaparnexus-demo-key-2026

### Health Live
GET {{VyaaparNexus.API_HostAddress}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

### Health Ready
GET {{VyaaparNexus.API_HostAddress}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### Metrics
GET {{VyaaparNexus.API_HostAddress}}/metrics
Accept: text/plain

### Get Products
GET {{VyaaparNexus.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/products
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Get Categories
GET {{VyaaparNexus.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/categories
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Get Customers
GET {{VyaaparNexus.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/customers
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Get Analytics Summary
GET {{VyaaparNexus.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/analytics/summary
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Get SSE Stream
GET {{VyaaparNexus.API_HostAddress}}/api/stream
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: text/event-stream

### Create Demo Order (Happy Path)
POST {{VyaaparNexus.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orders/demo
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{}

### Create Demo Order (Force Payment Failure)
POST {{VyaaparNexus.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orders/demo
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
X-Force-Failure: payment
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{}

### Create Demo Order (Force Inventory Failure)
POST {{VyaaparNexus.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orders/demo
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
X-Force-Failure: inventory
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{}
